---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../../components/SectionHeader.astro';

const lastUpdated = '1 June 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Essential 8 Knowledge Base Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for the Essential 8 Knowledge Base iOS app."
  robots="noindex, follow"
>
  <section class="section legal">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionHeader
        eyebrow="// app.privacy"
        title="Essential 8 Knowledge Base Privacy Policy"
        text={`Last updated: ${lastUpdated} AEST`}
      />

      <div class="notice surface-card">
        <p>
          This privacy policy applies only to the Essential 8 Knowledge Base iOS app. It is separate from
          the general MadDogWarner.com website privacy notice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <h2>Summary</h2>
        <p>
          Essential 8 Knowledge Base is an offline reference app for Australian system administrators
          working with the ASD Essential Eight in Windows environments.
        </p>
        <p>
          The app does not collect, record, store, transmit, sell, or share personal data.
        </p>

        <h2>Data collection</h2>
        <p>Essential 8 Knowledge Base does not collect user data or device data. The app does not use:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>accounts or login</li>
          <li>analytics SDKs</li>
          <li>advertising SDKs</li>
          <li>tracking technologies</li>
          <li>in-app purchases</li>
          <li>remote databases or cloud sync</li>
          <li>crash reporting or telemetry services</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Device permissions</h2>
        <p>
          The app does not request access to location, contacts, photos, camera, microphone, health data,
          Bluetooth, calendars, reminders, or device sensors.
        </p>

        <h2>Network access</h2>
        <p>
          No network access is required for the app's core functionality. The reference content is bundled
          with the app and is available offline.
        </p>
        <p>
          The app may include external reference links to resources such as ASD, ACSC, Microsoft, GitHub,
          or MadDogWarner. If you open an external link, it opens outside the app and the destination
          website's own privacy practices apply.
        </p>

        <h2>Local settings</h2>
        <p>
          The Microsoft 365 Additional Controls mode is stored locally on your device only. This setting is
          used to show or hide optional Microsoft 365 and Microsoft Defender reference notes inside the app.
          It is not transmitted to MadDogWarner or any third party.
        </p>

        <h2>Retention and deletion</h2>
        <p>
          Because the app does not collect personal data, there is no app-held personal data to retain,
          delete, export, or transfer. Removing the app from your device removes the locally stored app
          setting.
        </p>

        <h2>Third parties</h2>
        <p>
          Essential 8 Knowledge Base does not share user data with third parties. External websites opened
          from reference links are outside the app and are governed by their own privacy notices.
        </p>

        <h2>Affiliation</h2>
        <p>
          Essential 8 Knowledge Base is not affiliated with or endorsed by ASD, ACSC, Microsoft, Apple, or
          any other referenced organisation.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Privacy questions about Essential 8 Knowledge Base can be sent through the MadDogWarner contact
          page at <a href="/contact/">maddogwarner.com/contact/</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          This policy may be updated if the app's functionality or data handling changes. The updated date
          at the top of this page will be changed when this policy is revised.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding-top: 5rem;
  }

  .notice {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .notice p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 78ch;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 2rem 0 0.7rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  p,
  li {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 180, 255, 0.45);
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
